          "date": "2026-11-04 20:45:00.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-18687 lnet: do not include lustre_compat.h from lnet",
        "message": "LU-18687 lnet: do not include lustre_compat.h from lnet\n\nLU-20438 made lnet_rdma.c and o2iblnd.h include <lustre_compat.h>\nfrom lustre/include to get lustre_is_p2prdma_page(). LNet must not\ndepend on lustre/include: in the in-kernel build lnet has no such\ninclude path, so lnet_rdma.c fails to compile with\n\n  fatal error: 'lustre_compat.h' file not found\n\nMove the fallback into the lustre_compat mm.h shadow header as a\nplain is_pci_p2pdma_page() stub for kernels that lack it, and have\nthe callers use the kernel API name directly.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Ia6182b4f7506cfd3135c41916d3cb1b86a6a6964\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
